IMPORTANT:
- Harmonization did not delete any cleaned trips.
- Original cleaned operator datasets remain the source of truth.
- All harmonized Parquet files use one explicit canonical Arrow schema.
- trip_uid is globally unique across operators.
- vehicle_uid must be used for pooled vehicle analysis.
- distance_value_km is NOT semantically identical across operators.
- endpoint_displacement_km is the common geometric distance metric.
- endpoint_speed_kmh is a common kinematic diagnostic, not travelled route speed.
- 2025 operator coverage periods differ and must not be interpreted as comparable full-year totals.
